        a unique identifier. This is a simple
        integer that serves as an index into the
        current print documents inside of the current
        print requests.
        Document IDs are application defined. From the
        platform perspective, there is no meaning
        in the values themselves. The only requirement
        is that the ID values are unique.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:nonNegativeInteger"/>
