        does not supply this optional attribut a CUPPS 01.03 Issue 9 compliant
        platform will only return the data as masked.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:enumeration value="onlyMaskedData">
        <xs:annotation >
          <xs:documentation >
            The apps requesting this will only get masked MS data. This is also
            the default if not specified in the deviceAcquireRequest.
          </xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:enumeration>
      <xs:enumeration value="fullTrackData">
        <xs:annotation >
          <xs:documentation >
            The apps requesting this will get unmasked MS data if the platform
            still allows this. Note that this will put the app and the 
            plattform in-scope for PCI-DSS.
          </xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:enumeration>
    </xs:restriction>
  </xs:simpleType>


