      <xs:documentation >
        Print Request
        Result Type
        Multiple print documents are allowed in a
        single print request.  Each print request
        has a result code, as does each print
        document.  The print request result code
        is a macro result for the ease of the application
        developer.  The only need to check each
        document result code is if the print request
        result code indicates an issue.
      </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
      <xs:enumeration value="oneOrMoreIssues">
        <xs:annotation >
          <xs:documentation >
            One or more of the print documents
            contained in this print request has
            an issue.  Examine the individual
            print document results for details.
          </xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:enumeration>
