         <xs:documentation>
           poCapabilities have to be set for any BG that can fully support
           Self-Boarding as defined by AEA 2011. The content must match
           the AVOK Response from the device. 
         </xs:documentation>
       </xs:annotation> 
    </xs:attribute>
  </xs:complexType>


